# ── Reddit API — Phase 2 (disabled for now) ─────────────────
# Register a "script" app at https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=your_reddit_client_id_here
# REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_reddit_client_secret_here
# REDDIT_USER_AGENT=ApexEngine2.0/1.0 (by u/your_reddit_username)

# ── YouTube Data API — Phase 3 (optional) ───────────────────
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here

# NOTE: No secrets are required to run the engine right now.
# Google Trends (pytrends) and Kokoro TTS are both 100% free and
# require zero API keys. Ollama runs locally.
